<html>
<head>
    <title>第二步 - 配置网站信息</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="keywords" content="install,安装,SDF管理系统" />
    <meta name="description" content="SDF安装页面" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./sdf-public/sdf-assets/css/style.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<s-page theme="auto">
    <s-appbar>
        <div slot="headline"> 第二步 - 配置网站信息 </div>
    </s-appbar>
    
    <form action="./sdf-public/sdf-core/install.php" method="post" id="installForm">
        <!-- 隐藏字段用于传递值 -->
        <input type="hidden" name="title" id="realTitle">
        <input type="hidden" name="username" id="realUser">
        <input type="hidden" name="password" id="realPass">
        <input type="hidden" name="email" id="realEmail">
        <input type="hidden" name="domain" id="realDomain">
        <input type="hidden" name="step" value="2">

        <s-card style="display: block; height: none; max-width: none; margin : 10px;padding: 24px">
            <p>很好，SoberDesignForum管理系统已经成功连接了数据库并创建了数据表。</p>
    	    <p>现在，您需要填写一些信息，无需担心填错，这些信息以后可以再次修改。</p>    	    
            <br><br>
            
            <s-text-field 
                label="站点标题" 
                type="text"
                data-name="Title"
                onchange="document.getElementById('realTitle').value = this.value"
                style="width:100%"
            ></s-text-field>
            
            <s-text-field 
                label="管理员用户名" 
                type="text"
                data-name="User"
                onchange="document.getElementById('realUser').value = this.value"
            ></s-text-field>

            
            <s-text-field 
                label="管理员登录密码" 
                type="password"
                data-name="Pass"
                onchange="document.getElementById('realPass').value = this.value"
            ></s-text-field>

            
            <s-text-field 
                label="邮箱" 
                type="text"
                data-name="User"
                onchange="document.getElementById('realEmail').value = this.value"
            ></s-text-field>

            
            <s-text-field 
                label="您的域名" 
                type="text"
                data-name="Pass"
                onchange="document.getElementById('realDomain').value = this.value"
            ></s-text-field>


            <s-button 
                type="filled"
                onclick="submitForm()"
                style="display: flex"
            >下一步</s-button>
        </s-card>
    </form>
</s-page>

<script>
function submitForm() {
  // 确保所有字段都有值
  let valid = true;
  document.querySelectorAll('s-text-field').forEach(field => {
    if(!field.value) {
      valid = false;
    }
  });
  
  if(valid) {
    document.getElementById('installForm').submit();
  } else {
    alert("请填写所有字段");
  }
}
</script>


<script src="./sdf-public/sdf-assets/js/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="./sdf-public/sdf-assets/js/sober.js"></script>
<script src="./sdf-public/sdf-assets/js/vue.js"></script>

</body>
</html>